WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.963
Welcome back to Building
Global Secure Access.

2
00:00:02.963 --> 00:00:06.299
This is Chapter 3: the
client and its coverage.

3
00:00:06.299 --> 00:00:09.945
Every later policy assumes
the client is on the device,

4
00:00:09.945 --> 00:00:12.537
connected, current, and hard to turn off.

5
00:00:12.537 --> 00:00:16.637
This chapter measures that, device
by device and across the fleet.

6
00:00:16.637 --> 00:00:20.436
The guide already holds Learn's
Intune packaging and hardening,

7
00:00:20.436 --> 00:00:23.374
so we won't repeat them;
we'll build the measurement.

8
00:00:23.374 --> 00:00:26.147
The chapter has been
reviewed and approved,

9
00:00:26.147 --> 00:00:29.660
and the code is illustrative,
tested against fixtures.
